# Files that live in the repo but must not be served by the website.
#
# This file exists because the site moved from heal-ai-website/ up to the
# repo root (so GitHub Pages can host it). Before that move, the deploy
# root was the site subdirectory, and everything below was outside it and
# therefore never published. Now that the deploy root IS the repo root,
# anything not listed here becomes fetchable at a guessable URL.

# Internal planning documents. Not linked from any page — these were never
# public, and shouldn't silently become public just because the site moved.
HEAL AI Website Org Plan.docx.pdf
HEAL-AI_Master_Landscape_Report Final.docx.pdf

# Database schema and RLS policies. No credentials in them, but there's no
# reason to hand out a map of the table structure and every policy
# expression guarding it.
supabase/

# Source for the Google Apps Script sign-up endpoint. It runs inside the
# HEAL-AI Google account, not on this site, so serving it here would only
# publish its internals (sheet name, validation rules, honeypot field) to
# anyone probing the form.
google-apps-script/

# Repo metadata, not site content.
README.md
.claude/
.nojekyll
